{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（15日）凌晨2時許，警方接報一名年約40歲男子在西貢滘西洲對開海面漂浮，懷疑遇溺，途經舢舨的船家將男事主救起，送往早禾坑碼頭。</p><p>男事主昏迷送往將軍澳醫院，惜搶救後證實不治。</p><p>警方正調查事件。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:36.385190+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T02:23:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T09:17:45.039825+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416321+00:00","content_hash":"2027094c8954ea1b8d6075250ab0e0549e87aa06aa19e6a0c11ce1ac39298473","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}